WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.637
Practice without real money.

2
00:00:01.757 --> 00:00:05.333
Simulator prices and cash are generated for education.

3
00:00:05.453 --> 00:00:09.609
This is a place to practice a process, not predict actual returns.

4
00:00:10.129 --> 00:00:11.406
Read before you act.

5
00:00:11.526 --> 00:00:17.737
Search a symbol, examine its candlestick chart, and use Sprouty’s chart tour to understand the controls.

6
00:00:17.857 --> 00:00:19.436
Define what you might lose.

7
00:00:19.962 --> 00:00:21.042
Review your order.

8
00:00:21.162 --> 00:00:24.842
Choose an affordable quantity and review the order before confirming.

9
00:00:24.962 --> 00:00:27.679
The first-trade walkthrough explains each step.

10
00:00:28.212 --> 00:00:29.896
Reflect after practice.

11
00:00:30.016 --> 00:00:32.918
Review the completed trade and write a short journal note.

12
00:00:33.038 --> 00:00:36.463
Focus on the quality of your reasoning rather than a profit target.

